    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_p1">Controller: the APhid team. We comply with Peru\'s Personal Data Protection Law 29733 and its regulation (S.D. 016-2024-JUS).</string>
    <string name="privacy_p2">Local data by default: your systems, readings, formulas and photos are stored only on this phone. No account or name required.</string>
    <string name="privacy_p3">Cloud only with your express consent: if you analyze a photo in the cloud, that photo and your notes go to our server and to Anthropic (Claude) only for that diagnosis.</string>
    <string name="privacy_p4">We do not use your data for advertising. Telemetry is off by default. Android cloud auto-backup is disabled.</string>
    <string name="privacy_p5">Your rights: access, rectify, cancel and object. Export everything as JSON or use \"Delete all my data\" in Settings at any time.</string>
    <string name="privacy_p6">Contact: privacidad@aphid.pe. You may file a complaint with Peru\'s National Data Protection Authority.</string>
